<title>FINLAND: ATRIA H1 PROFIT DOWN TO FIM 15 MLN.</title>
<headline>ATRIA H1 PROFIT DOWN TO FIM 15 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p>Profit before extraordinaries,</p>
<p>  appropriations, taxes		     15 vs 39</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    0.94 vs 3.04</p>
<p> Net sales				   1,070 vs 1,051</p>
<p> Operating margin			     75 vs 109</p>
<p> Depreciation				   45 vs 53</p>
<p> Net financial items		 charge 15 vs 17 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			 nil vs nil</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes    15 vs 39</p>
<p> Net profit				     11 vs 35</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' mean forecast was for a 29 million markka</p>
<p>profit before extraordinary items in a 21-38 million markka</p>
<p>range.</p>
<p>- Full name of Finnish foodstuffs group is Atria Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0248</p>
